        "2508.07970_rag::chunk_010"^^xsd:string,
        "2510.19225_rag::chunk_002"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasEvidenceText "ByteScale , an efficient, flexible, and scalable training framework designed for large-scale mixed training"^^xsd:string,
        "To accommodate elastic resource scaling, we utilize distributed checkpointing and design the dataloader consumption state such that checkpoints can be reused across GPU clusters of varying sizes."^^xsd:string,
        "Training deep learning models is a repetitive and resource-intensive process."^^xsd:string,
        "enabling model partitioning across multiple nodes."^^xsd:string,
        "these spare GPU resources often suffer from fragmentation at multiple levels, leading to significant communication overhead."^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :entity,
        owl:Thing ;
    skos:altLabel "Distributed Training System"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:skos_definition "A training process involving the coordination of multiple computational resources, often utilizing techniques like distributed checkpointing to handle elastic resource scaling."^^xsd:string ;
