    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2210_14826_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "out data processing to remote CPU servers, which effectively eliminates input data stalls for jobs that are input-bound with colocated data preprocessing. Even when accounting for the cost of the extra remote CPU servers in the service deployment, we observe significant overall cost savings for training jobs (26.2 on average) with disaggregated data preprocessing due to substantial speedups (31.7 on average) that come from ensuring ML accelerators do not stall for data. The speedups translate in" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2210_14826_rag__chunk_022> a kg:Chunk ;
