    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2301_02959_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "places sequence DLRM embedding tables at a per embedding row granularity . FlexShard is built upon the insight that not every row is equal with respect to their system demands, and that careful, precise replication of certain rows can result in savings of both time and memory compared to the existing state-of-the-art industry sequence sharding strategy. Furthermore, FlexShard leverages the knowledge that real-world hardware network topologies are often heterogeneous, with non-equal bandwidth acr" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2301_02959_rag__chunk_005> a kg:Chunk ;
