    kg:docId "2308.08500_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2308_08500_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "or requiring large-scale cluster changes. feedback-driven, adaptive tool to optimize data ingestion pipelines that we name InTune. InTune serves as a drop-in replacement for industry-standard optimizers such as tf.data s AUTOTUNE , requiring no large-scale cluster redesigns or workflow disruptions. It can be applied to any data pipeline framework, including tf.data , PyTorch Datasets, and Ray Datasets. At the core of InTune is a reinforcement learning (RL) agent trained on historical job traces " .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2308_08500_rag__chunk_007> a kg:Chunk ;
