    kg:textSpan "the optimizer to actively respond to hardware changes. Figure 5(C) charts the performance of various approaches in this setting. We see that out-of-the-box AUTOTUNE does not respond effectively to machine re-sizing, and does not increase pipeline throughput even when new CPUs are provided to the job. If human intervention is used to reset and re-launch AUTOTUNE , the scaling improves but is still significantly under-performs the fully-human alternative. This reliance on human decision-making and" .

