    kg:textSpan "edge-level, and graph-level tasks form the core learning tasks of graph machine learning, enabling a comprehensive analysis and understanding of complex graph data. 111:6 Zheng and Liu, et al. Fig. 2. The framework and taxonomy of data-centric graph machine learning (DC-GML). These tasks provide valuable insights and facilitate applications across diverse domains, including social network analysis, bioinformatics, recommendation systems, and many others. 3 FRAMEWORK & TAXONOMY The proposed frame" .

