    kg:textSpan "framework ( e.g. , Kubeflow [ 81 ], Amazon SageMaker [ 6 ]) to customized solutions for certain applications ( e.g. , Amazon Neptune [ 179 ]). In summary, the overall objective of MLOps is productionizing machine learning systems with the cooperation of data operations (DataOps) and development operations (DevOps). From MLOps to Graph MLOps? As a prevalent and typical structural data, graph MLOps not only requires all the above-mentioned general components, but also demands unique characteristic" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2309_10979_rag__chunk_031> a kg:Chunk ;
