    kg:textSpan "[ 213 ]. By delving into these specific enhancement and exploitation strategies, researchers can advance the capabilities of DC-GML in handling complex and diverse real-world graph data. General and automatic graph data improvement. In Sec. 4, we have observed that most existing DC-GML works focus on addressing graph data availability or quality issues to enhance graph data in isolation. Specifically, they typically tackle one aspect of graph data, such as its structure, features, labels, or siz" .

