    kg:textSpan "USP: A Unified Sequence Parallelism Approach for Long Context Generative AI Jiarui Fang Tencent jiaruifang@tencent.com Shangchun Zhao Tencent doctzhao@tencent.com arXiv:2405.07719v5 [cs.LG] 2 Jul 2024 Abstract Sequence parallelism (SP), which divides the sequence dimension of input tensors across multiple computational devices, is becoming key to unlocking the longcontext capabilities of generative AI models. This paper investigates the state-ofthe-art SP approaches, i.e. DeepSpeed-Ulysses and R" .

