    kg:textSpan "it or is there some issue to using SP with it together, remains an open question. After addressing these questions, we have provided a list of best practices for building a 4D hybrid parallelism system. The primary contributions of this paper include: We propose a unified sequence parallel method that integrates DeepSpeed-Ulysses and Ring-Attention, overcoming the shortcomings of both and demonstrating greater robustness to model architecture and network hardware. We systematically analyze the a" .

