    kg:textSpan "features are changed. Figure 17 illustrates a comparison of the average latency to execute each operation using Disagg and PreSto . While the latency of Disagg increases almost proportionally with the number of features for preprocessing, PreSto does a much better job leveraging inter-/intra-feature parallelism and consistently achieves significant speedups, demonstrating the robustness of our proposal. VII. R ELATED WORK There is a large body of prior literature exploring DNN preprocessing, Rec" .

