    kg:textSpan "generates an intermediate buffer [ N, B, C ] regardless of C . Activation checkpoint ( AC. ) is also a commonly used strategy in large model training, as it can significantly reduce the GPU memory pressure for models with many layers. Activation checkpoint with offloading ( OC. ) is a technique introduced in DeepSpeed, which allows the checkpointed activation to be moved to host memory. Both AC. and OC. play critical roles in enlarging the sequence length, i.e., from 32K to 128K to 512K. For Uly" .

