    kg:textSpan "two key issues in the Generation and Training stage within existing RLHF training systems that contribute to substantial GPU under-utilization. Generation Stage: data skewness. One major problem in the generation stage is that the response length of generated samples exhibits a long-tailed distribution, meaning that a few samples are significantly longer than the others. Due to data dependencies, the inference tasks cannot start until the generation task finishes. Consequently, even only a few l" .

