    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2412_20166_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "mapping to yield performance gains. A. Conventional KV Cache Management in PIM PIM-based systems accelerate Attention computations by managing the KV cache directly within their memory modules. However, existing systems rely on an inefficient static memory management scheme, as illustrated in Fig. 10(a). To handle the worst-case scenario, memory is preallocated based on the maximum possible token length. This leads to severe memory capacity underutilization when the actual token length is shorte" .

