    kg:textSpan "occupying just 0.47% of the MAC unit area [40] per PIM bank, estimated by synthesizing the output buffer logic using CACTI [8]. In addition, enabling DCS within PIM controllers in PIM HUB [30], [35], [37] adds only a negligible controller cost: across all HUB control blocks [62], the area increases by 0.5% and the power by 1.3%. This overhead accounts for the additional dependency-tracking structures and logic required by DCS, including a per-controller 576B metadata table (D-Table and S-Table) " .

