    kg:textSpan "L., Zhang, M., Han, J., and Gao, J. Model tells you what to discard: Adaptive kv cache compression for llms, 2024. URL https://arxiv. org/abs/2310.01801 . Grattafiori, A., Dubey, A., Jauhri, A., Pandey, A., Kadian, A., Al-Dahle, A., Letman, A., Mathur, A., Schelten, A., Vaughan, A., Yang, A., Fan, A., Goyal, A., Hartshorn, A., Yang, A., Mitra, A., Sravankumar, A., Korenev, A., Hinsvark, A., Rao, A., Zhang, A., Rodriguez, A., Gregerson, A., Spataru, A., Roziere, B., Biron, B., Tang, B., Chern, B." .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2502_13189_rag__chunk_004> a kg:Chunk ;
