    kg:textSpan "Mixtera: A Data Plane for Foundation Model Training Maximilian Bther ETH Zurich, Switzerland Xiaozhe Yao ETH Zurich, Switzerland Tolga Kerimoglu ETH Zurich, Switzerland Dan Graur ETH Zurich, Switzerland Viktor Gsteiger ETH Zurich, Switzerland Ana Klimovic ETH Zurich, Switzerland ABSTRACT 1B (Dynamic) 1B (Static) 3B (Dynamic) 3B (Static) 0.45 State-of-the-art large language and vision models are trained over trillions of tokens that are aggregated from a large variety of sources. As training data" .

