    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2504_20067_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "and memory utilization are similar to those without the inference load. The Fig. 10 shows the throughput. The throughput increases as we switch the data loader from PyTorch to SPDL, then Python version 3.12 to 3.13 and finally to Free-Threaded Python. The Table. 3 summarizes the peak throughput. When compared against PyTorch DataLoader on 3.12, SPDL R EFERENCES Figure 10. The throughput of SPDL over different Python versions including FT Python and PyTorch DataLoader as a baseline. Abadi, M., Ba" .

