    kg:textSpan "need for transporting activation and gradients via p2p communication between pipeline stages, each pipeline stage is often mapped to a GPU server, and the p2p relies on fast inter-node channels like Infiniband [27]. Pipeline bubble. As visualized in Figure 2a, the pipeline bubble equals to 1 forward and backward executions of / transformer layers in each stage. Let + + denote the layer forward time, in which the three items denote the time of pre-attention, attention and post-attention respectiv" .

