    kg:docId "2507.19457_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2507_19457_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "untrusted models. The core challenges are maintaining high response quality while minimizing leakage of personally identifiable information (PII) to untrusted models. Li et al. (2025a) also present PAPILLON, a compound AI system consisting of 2 modules, a user query rewriter and a response rewriter, run over the trusted model, along with an intermediate call to the untrusted model with the rewritten query. The feedback text simply provides the breakdown of the aggregate score, consisting of a re" .

