    kg:textSpan "issue. To address this problem, we propose a heavy-hitter-aware load-balancing algorithm that handles heavy hitters and normal segments differently. Heavy hitter is defined as frequently accessed segments. For normal segments, TokenLake employs a hash-based distribution strategy to spread them uniformly across all instances. A hash function is used to map each segment to an instance. Given that normal segments are numerous, this method typically achieves effective load balancing without migratio" .

