    kg:textSpan "preemptible instances for rollout, the average response length tends to grow as RL training progresses [ 42 ]. These factors cause unpredictable changes in rollout and training times throughout the RL training process. Beyond the challenge of identifying the optimal seeding window, another question is how many preemptible instances should we actually use, even when availability is unlimited. Given their cost advantages, we can follow the established practices in [ 9 , 23 , 37 ] and use as many i" .

