    kg:textSpan "function call generated by R EA L. The plan of R EA L considers parameter reallocation for the actor and critic model. we conduct a thorough profile and discover two major limitations. First, we note that many systems apply the same parallelization strategy that spreads across the entire GPU cluster for all LLMs. We name this a symmetric parallelization strategy, which often leads to over-parallelization . Our system profiling in Figure 1 (top) shows that overparallelization leads to substantial" .

