    kg:textSpan "model quality using long-context benchmarks (see Section 4.2) and quantify efficiency through latency measurements. All latency results in the experimental section focus solely on the attention computation time across all layers during the LLM prefilling phase. Our latency measurements include all online operations, such as quantization, block selection, and index selection. In some experiments, we report the end-to-end (E2E) latency on certain datasets, which is computed by summing the latency " .

