    kg:textSpan "of micro batches available for pipeline parallelism . For example, Llama 3 405B with 128k sequence length is trained using a batch size of 16 and 16 pipeline stages. Such a pipeline is merely saturated, further amplifying the inefficiency introduced by the pipeline bubble. 4 HelixPipe 4.1 Overview This work proposes HelixPipe to alleviate the pipeline bubble and memory imbalance for long sequence transformer model training. HelixPipe adopts a fine grained attention parallel partition to remove t" .

