    kg:textSpan "During this, in-progress trajectory states remain safe in the partial response pool. The rollout manager redirects interrupted trajectories to healthy rollouts with the same weight version, or waits for replacement machines if none are available. Recovery is swift as new machines initialize rollouts and corresponding relays by synchronizing with the master relay for the latest weights or loading specific weight versions from actor checkpointing files. Relay faults during weight synchronization a" .

