    kg:textSpan "than between computing nodes. Conversely, Ring Attention demands inter-node communication during every iteration, which can be less efficient. 3) Enhanced Overlap of Communication and Computation : During each iteration, the communication volume of StarTrail is C times higher than that of Ring Attention, while the computational volume during attention is approximately C 2 times greater. This higher computation-to-communication ratio makes it easier for StarTrail to overlap P2P communication with" .

