    kg:textSpan "We empirically found that profiling 50 100 steps (batches) leads to high accuracy with small overheads [ 33 ], as training a model takes hundreds of epochs, each of which consists of a few hundreds of steps. We show the profiling overhead in our evaluation. There are three types of metrics for profiling. First, to measure the GPU throughput of the model gradient computations ( = ( ) ), FastFlow removes the prep stall by caching the preprocessed data of the first step in memory and reusing them t" .

