    kg:textSpan "Figure 7 ( Left ). 7 Conclusion To address the critical challenge of efficiency in long-context LLM training, we introduce two training paradigms: SeCO and its enhanced variant SpaCO. By partitioning the input sequence into smaller, manageable chunks and performing localized backpropagation for each chunk, SeCO achieves substantial memory savings. Building upon this foundation, SpaCO introduces a carefully designed sparsification mechanism that randomly selects few chunks for backpropagation, re" .

