    kg:textSpan "each iteration of the inference process, the prefix cache only involves the attention module. In each layer, query tensors generated from the input tokens use prefix attention and self-attention to interact with all preceding KV cache and KV cache of themselves, respectively, and then reduce the partial output tensors and normalizers to generate the final output tensors of the attention module. Therefore, except for the prefix attention, which is cache-aware , self-attention and all other operat" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2508_18572_rag__chunk_001> a kg:Chunk ;
