    kg:textSpan "Laminar: A Scalable Asynchronous RL Post-Training Framework Guangming Sheng 1 , Yuxuan Tong 2 , Borui Wan 1 , Wang Zhang 2 , Chaobo Jia 2 , Xibin Wu 2 , Yuqi Wu 2 , Xiang Li 2 , Chi Zhang 2 , Yanghua Peng 2 , Haibin Lin 2 , Xin Liu 2 , Chuan Wu 1 1 The University of Hong Kong 2 ByteDance Seed Training Stage Generation Stage 100 16.9 18.3 Abstract Reinforcement learning (RL) post-training for Large Language Models (LLMs) is now scaling to large clusters and running for extended durations to enhan" .

