    kg:textSpan "Parallelism The key mechanism behind these Transformer-based models is attention[ 38 ], which captures the text feature by calculating the attention score between every two single tokens. However, the sequence length can reach hundreds of thousands, when dealing with multi-round chatting, or high-resolution long video generation. It then becomes necessary to distribute the sequence across multiple GPUs. This distribution helps to reduce both the memory and computation demands on any single devic" .

