    kg:textSpan "wave of research aimed at improving efficiency without sacrificing performance. One prominent direction capitalizes on the inherent sparsity of attention scores. This sparsity arises both mathematically from the softmax operation, where various sparse attention patterns have be studied (H. Jiang et al. 2024) and biologically (Watson et al. 2025), where sparse connectivity is observed in brain regions related to memory storage. zhang mingxing@mail.tsinghua.edu.cn Co-corresponding authors. Xinyu Z" .

