    kg:textSpan ") architecture, KV cache chunks within the same layer are independent and computed in parallel. As a result, errors propagate from one KV cache chunk to another only between adjacent layers ( Dai et al. , 2019 ), as shown in Figure 4 . Thus, the maximum gradient chain length is bounded by the number of layers. Theoretically, unbiased gradient estimation is achievable if the number of selected chunks meets the number of layers, ensuring sufficient coverage. Figure 4: In the Transformer architectu" .

