    kg:textSpan "followed by multiple <Thread> s. Importantly, only the thread contents are generated in parallel , while all remaining parts of the trajectory are generated via standard autoregressive (AR) decoding. This design allows parallel inference to be implemented on top of any model exposed through a request-completion interface, such as an LLM inference server with API backed by an autoregressive inference engine like SGLang ( Zheng et al. , 2024 ) or vLLM ( Kwon et al. , 2023 ), without any modificati" .

