    kg:textSpan "of Contributions. To address the aforementioned challenges, we propose ByteScale , an efficient, flexible, and scalable training framework designed for large-scale mixed training of long and short sequences. The main contributions are as follows: C1: Proposal of Hybrid Data Parallelism . We propose a novel parallelism strategy, namely Hybrid Data Parallelism (HDP), which unifies both inter-data (DP) and intra-data partitioning (CP), and is defined to evenly distributing tokens across devices. It" .

